{"id":"n79235-4-7","stage":4,"title":"치밀다 · 向上推","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79235-4-7-1","ko":"내려서 차 좀 치밀어 봐.","zh":"请下来帮我把车推一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내려서","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내리다：下，下去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치밀어","meaning":"向上推，往上推","explanation":"치밀다：向上推，往上推；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"치밀다","audio":"/audio/275be0d66725d79a5857.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79235","senseId":"4","lemma":"치밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的交通工具上出来而到某处。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"275be0d66725d79a","term":"치밀다","zh":"向上推，往上推","audio":"/audio/275be0d66725d79a5857.mp3","entryId":"79235","definition":"自下而上猛推。","pronunciation":["치밀다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/38feedece7aa43ac30a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79235-4-7-2","ko":"나 혼자서 이 무거운 차를 어떻게 밀어?","zh":"我一个人要怎么推得动这么重的车呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자서","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独；서：接在人数表达等后，强调这些人是动作的主体，如 혼자서（独自）。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무거운","meaning":"重，沉","explanation":"무겁다：重，沉；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"1","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀어?","meaning":"推","explanation":"밀다：推；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"밀다","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74177","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"91e3eab0a3ea6c9e","term":"무겁다","zh":"重，沉","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3","entryId":"58159","definition":"重量大。","pronunciation":["무겁따"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"2e251676952afc35","term":"밀다","zh":"推","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3","entryId":"74177","definition":"向想要的方向用力使物体移动。","pronunciation":["밀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e30f5fd201109f3460c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.855,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79235","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6817,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我一个人要怎么推得动这么重的车呢？","请下来帮我把车推一下吧。","我们打算给孩子定制一套韩服。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请下来帮我把车推一下吧。","我们打算给孩子定制一套韩服。","我一个人要怎么推得动这么重的车呢？"],"answer":2}]}
